                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 6,
                            "playtime_at_review": 3806,
                            "last_played": 1793837187
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "TLDR: It's solid, it's fun. Buy it, Play it, Feel sad it's over. Play it more and feel happy again.\n\nPros: Solid first person roguelite shooter.... or use a sword, whatever makes you happy. Game is extremely balanced. All the weapons are balanced a are capable of carrying you. The classes play differently enough be engaging and give you a reason to try new things. It's fun with friends as well. Unlocks feel good. Secrets to find. Choices feel impactful. Movement is some of the best I've seen in a game like this. Cell shading is great so the graphics will always hold up. Never puts soo many particles on the screen you can't tell what is going on. Aiming is rewarded, not required.\n\nCons: Dev's are done developing it so no new patches or content. This aside, it's Solid. They put it in a great spot before moving on. I wish other devs put this much care into their products. \n",
